{"type":"message","id":"00a1274b","parentId":"cdab08a0","timestamp":"2026-02-01T16:04:52.684Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01HAzMnzRA1NizwKsrUfXWRR","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/clawdbot-setup-guide/QUICKSTART.md","content":"# Clawdbot Quick Start\n\n> For experienced users. No hand-holding. See [GUIDE.md](GUIDE.md) for the full walkthrough.\n\n## EC2\n\n```bash\n# Amazon Linux 2023, t3.medium, 30GB gp3, SSH-only security group\n# Attach Elastic IP after launch\n\nssh -i key.pem ec2-user@YOUR_IP\n```\n\n## System Setup\n\n```bash\nsudo dnf update -y\nsudo dnf install -y git jq htop\ncurl -o- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvm-sh/nvm/v0.40.1/install.sh | bash\nsource ~/.bashrc\nnvm install 22\nnpm install -g pm2 clawdbot\npm2 startup  # Run the command it outputs\n```\n\n## Init\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p ~/clawd && cd ~/clawd\nclawdbot init\n```\n\n## Config\n\n```bash\n# Edit config (path shown by `clawdbot gateway status`)\n# Or patch directly:\nclawdbot gateway config.patch '{\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"anthropic\": { \"apiKey\": \"sk-ant-...\" },\n    \"openai\": { \"apiKey\": \"sk-...\" }\n  },\n  \"channels\": {\n    \"telegram\": {\n      \"token\": \"BOT_TOKEN\",\n      \"allowedUsers\": [\"YOUR_USER_ID\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"brave\": { \"apiKey\": \"BSA_...\" }\n  }\n}'\n```\n\n## Launch\n\n```bash\nclawdbot gateway start\npm2 start \"clawdbot gateway start\" --name clawdbot-gateway\npm2 save\n```\n\n## Verify\n\n```bash\nclawdbot gateway status\npm2 status\n```\n\nMessage your bot on Telegram. If it responds, you're done.\n\n## Security (Do This Now)\n\n```bash\nchmod 700 ~/clawd\nchmod 600 ~/.config/clawdbot/*\n```\n\nEnsure `allowedUsers` is set to your Telegram user ID only.\n\n## Key Files to Edit\n\n| File | What | Priority |\n|------|------|----------|\n| `SOUL.md` | AI personality | Do first |\n| `USER.md` | About you | Do first |\n| `AGENTS.md` | Operating rules | Customize over time |\n| `HEARTBEAT.md` | Proactive checks | When ready |\n\n## Resources\n\n- Docs: https://docs.clawd.bot\n- Skills: https://clawdhub.com\n- Discord: https://discord.com/invite/clawd\n- GitHub: https://github.com/clawdbot/clawdbot\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":742,"cacheRead":12773,"cacheWrite":11074,"totalTokens":24590,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.01855,"cacheRead":0.0063865,"cacheWrite":0.06921250000000001,"total":0.09415400000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769961879319}}
