{"type":"message","id":"6cd6be2c","parentId":"646aec41","timestamp":"2026-02-01T16:05:05.322Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three files created:\n\n1. **GUIDE.md** (~37KB) — Comprehensive 13-part guide covering everything from AWS setup to troubleshooting, with conversational tone, code blocks, tables, tips/warnings, and practical examples from a real setup.\n\n2. **QUICKSTART.md** — Stripped-down version for experienced users — just commands, no explanation.\n\n3. **examples/gateway-config.example.json** — Clean, commented config template ready to copy-paste.\n\nNo real API keys, no personal info, all official links referenced. Ready to share publicly."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":134,"cacheRead":24636,"cacheWrite":558,"totalTokens":25329,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.00335,"cacheRead":0.012317999999999999,"cacheWrite":0.0034875,"total":0.0191605}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1769961900008}}
